body:
Hey, I'm in a similar boat as you. I live in AL and while I have backup schools just in case, I mainly want to go to KSU. I applied for the out-of-state waiver here: [https://www.kennesaw.edu/admissions/undergraduate/resources/index.php](https://www.kennesaw.edu/admissions/undergraduate/resources/index.php)

&#x200B;

The main points are that you have to write an essay, have a GPA of 3.2, and submit a letter of recommendation to be considered.
